#: Modules/Compatibility/CompatibilityRemediationManager.php:684
msgid ""
"%s was deactivated. Its saved settings were not deleted. NBH Performance "
"rechecked the active optimization owners."
msgstr ""
"%s was deactivated. Its সংরক্ষিত সেটিংস হয়নি মুছে ফেলা হয়েছে. NBH "
"পারফরম্যান্স rechecked the সক্রিয় অপ্টিমাইজেশন owners."

#: Modules/Compatibility/CompatibilityRemediationManager.php:528
msgid ""
"%s will be deactivated, but its database settings will be preserved. NBH "
"Performance will then recheck the environment."
msgstr ""
"%s হবে deactivated, but its ডেটাবেস সেটিংস হবে preserved. NBH পারফরম্যান্স "
"will then recheck the environment."

